# 🔒 Private Obsidian Vault

This repository stores a private, secure backup of your Obsidian vault, synchronized automatically by **SuperSync**.

## ⚠️ Important Notes
* **Keep Private**: This repository contains your personal notes. Do not make this repository public.
* **Automated Sync**: Files are synced automatically by the SuperSync plugin. Avoid manual modifications to the files directly on GitHub to prevent sync conflicts.
